  "housingDecisionSectionBody": "Before choosing the city, understand how rent and guarantees work in Brazil. The biggest risk is not only monthly price: it is landing without a viable path for contract, neighborhood, and initial setup.",
  "housingDecisionSectionBodyWithCity": "Before assuming {city} is the best option, validate whether rent, guarantees, and initial setup look viable for your moment. The risk is not only price, but the real path to secure housing.",
