  "housingDecisionGuaranteesTitle": "Guarantees can block the lease",
  "housingDecisionGuaranteesBody": "A local guarantor still matters in many contracts. If that is not realistic for you, compare deposit, guarantee insurance, capitalization products, and income proof demands before counting on a neighborhood.",
  "housingDecisionSoftLandingTitle": "A softer landing avoids expensive mistakes",
  "housingDecisionSoftLandingBody": "Temporary, furnished, coliving, or short contracts for 30 to 90 days are usually safer than taking a long lease before you understand local routine.",
  "housingDecisionProofPackTitle": "Carry the folder that unlocks the conversation",
  "housingDecisionProofPackBody": "Keep identity, income, cash reserve, references, and digital proof in one folder. It does not guarantee approval, but it reduces friction from the first contact.",
  "housingDecisionCityReadTitle": "Read the city through housing pressure",
