  "housingDecisionCityReadBody": "Do not compare only average rent. Look at neighborhoods, transport, nearby services, furniture needs, commute distance, and cash margin for deposit and surprises.",
  "housingDecisionCityReadBodyWithCity": "In {city}, compare neighborhoods, transport, nearby services, furniture needs, and cash margin for deposit and surprises before treating housing as solved.",
