  "housingEntryModeDepositBody": "Typical reading when the lease asks for roughly 3 months of deposit plus the first month.",
  "housingEntryModeInsuranceBody": "Typical reading when a guarantor is replaced by an annual insurance or digital guarantee fee.",
  "housingEntryModeTemporaryBody": "A lighter reading for the first 30 to 90 days, prioritizing flexibility before taking a long lease.",
